Alembic owns all new database changes after the frozen legacy SQL baseline (db/migrations/0001-0030).

Run from the repository root:

    uv run alembic -c backend/database/alembic.ini upgrade head

For a new database, apply the legacy SQL baseline first. Existing databases can run `upgrade head`
directly: the first Alembic revision records the no-op legacy baseline before applying new revisions.
